<title>SWITZERLAND: Swissair Cargo Jan 97 traffic down 1.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Swissair Cargo Jan 97 traffic down 1.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Cargo, the cargo arm of Swissair, said January 1997 cargo shipments totalled 106.8 million freight tonne kilometres FTK, down 1.4 percent on the same month last year.</p>
<p>Swiss Cargo' January 1997 traffic, expressed in million FTK, with percentage change on January 1996, was as follows:</p>
<p>Traffic area		    Jan 1997	   Jan 1996</p>
<p>				  (in million FTK)</p>
<p>Europe			     4.9		up   6.9 pct</p>
<p>North America		   40.0	    down   7.9 pct</p>
<p>South Atlantic		   4.2		up  46.7 pct</p>
<p>Middle East			4.9	    down   0.8 pct</p>
<p>Japan				8.8		up  19.8 pct</p>
<p>Far East			  41.2	    down   3.6 pct</p>
<p>Africa			    11.7		up   0.6 pct</p>
<p>Total worldwide		106.8 mln	down   1.4 pct</p>
<p>--Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44-171-542-7706  Fax +5017</p>
</text>
